			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d1c0000-0007-4000-8000-000000000007")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT THIS STORY DELIBERATELY DOES NOT DECIDE\n\n  * Anything in firmware. No project skeleton, no linker script, no register write. #50 and #52.\n  * The epoch record's field layout. #51 owns the wire format; this sheet only fixes that it is\n    bounded and fixed-stride, because the storage decision above depends on that and nothing else.\n  * The property boundary geometry. The plat's corners and the cul-de-sac arc live in the owner's CAD\n    repo. Not here.\n  * The phone app and the desk-side GIS / PPK pipeline. Out of scope for this repo entirely.\n  * The chassis. Wheelbase and wheel diameter set the effective topographic resolution (#54 measures\n    it), and the only thing these sheets impose on the chassis is the mast height and the 1 m of\n    separation between the two antennas."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 431.8 228.7608 0)
